@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `law08-vintage`
IMPORT `law08-nouns`
IMPORT `law08-ch3-scope`

-- Tests for Dieu 62-63. Dieu 63(3)(b) and (c) are replaced by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2) from 1 January
-- 2026: "bao hiem cho rui ro tu vong" (V1) becomes "bao hiem tu ky" (V2, V3). Each scenario is run in V1 and
-- in V2; V3 is the same text as V2 for this article.

§ `Tests: Dieu 62-63`

§§ `Dieu 62`

@@q 1135 1138
#ASSERT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `a joint stock company`
#ASSERT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` `another form of organisation`

§§ `Dieu 63(1)-(2)`

@@q 1141 1153
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a life insurer` `insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a non-life insurer` `supplying ancillary insurance services`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` `managing funds and investing capital from insurance business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a life insurer` `reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a reinsurer` `reinsurance business and ceding`
#ASSERT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a branch of a foreign reinsurer` `another activity directly related to reinsurance business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a reinsurer` `supplying ancillary insurance services`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` `a microinsurance mutual organisation` `reinsurance business and ceding`

§§ `Dieu 63(3)`

@@q 1154 1163
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1154-1163)
@@fx `a ten-year life product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 120
@@fx `a ten-year health product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `health insurance` ; `term in months` = 120
@@fx `a one-year health product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `health insurance` ; `term in months` = 12
@@fx `a thirteen-month health product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `health insurance` ; `term in months` = 13
@@fx `a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 12 ; `covers the risk of death` = TRUE
@@fx `a thirteen-month death-cover product (V1 words)` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 13 ; `covers the risk of death` = TRUE
@@fx `a one-year term-life product (V2 words)` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 12 ; `is a term-life product` = TRUE
@@fx `a motor product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `non-life insurance` ; `term in months` = 12
@@fx `a life insurer with a health product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a ten-year life product`, `a ten-year health product`
@@fx `a life insurer with a motor product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a ten-year life product`, `a motor product`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a ten-year health product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a ten-year health product`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a one-year health product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year health product`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month health product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a thirteen-month health product`
@@fx `a foreign branch with a one-year health product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year health product`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month death-cover product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a thirteen-month death-cover product (V1 words)`
@@fx `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a one-year term-life product (V2 words)`
@@fx `a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a health insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a one-year death-cover product (V1 words)`
@@fx `a health insurer with a one-year term-life product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a health insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a one-year term-life product (V2 words)`
@@fx `a health insurer with a one-year health-only product and a motor product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a health insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a ten-year health product`, `a motor product`
@@fx `a reinsurer's business` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a reinsurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`

-- (a): a life insurer may carry on health insurance, whatever the term: the same in every vintage.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a health product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a motor product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a life insurer with a motor product`)
-- (b), the health limb: a term of one year or less, the same words in V1 and V2.
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a ten-year health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year health product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month health product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a foreign branch with a one-year health product`)
-- (b), the death limb: V1 says "bao hiem cho rui ro tu vong" and V2 says "bao hiem tu ky" (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2)).
@@qa 32 39
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a thirteen-month death-cover product`)
-- (c): a health insurer, the same change.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year term-life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a health insurer with a one-year health-only product and a motor product`)
-- Before the Law took effect the death limb answers with a refusal, not with V1's answer.
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2022 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a non-life insurer with a one-year death-cover product`)
-- A reinsurer is not governed by Dieu 63(3).
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` `a reinsurer's business`)
